  "label": "User projected onto the goat as the speaker in heaven",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual entity 'goat' which is anthropomorphized as speaking or singing in a heavenly context. The goat's open mouth and expressive face, combined with the text 'i hear in heaven', create an implicit identification where the viewer imagines themselves as the goat experiencing or reporting this heavenly vision. This projection is reinforced by the surreal and humorous framing, allowing the user to identify with the goat's perspective and the absurd scenario.",
